From: SoundTap contributors <soundtap@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep SoundTap as the single master gain

Keep librespot's volume state and Spotify Connect events, but do not
attenuate PCM a second time. SoundTap applies the single master gain.

Upstream: Not applicable (SoundTap-specific volume policy)
Signed-off-by: Stein Milder <info@steinmilder.nl>

---
 playback/src/mixer/softmixer.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/playback/src/mixer/softmixer.rs b/playback/src/mixer/softmixer.rs
index b003a42..f4400e1 100644
--- a/playback/src/mixer/softmixer.rs
+++ b/playback/src/mixer/softmixer.rs
@@ -51,5 +51,5 @@ impl VolumeGetter for SoftVolume {
     #[inline]
     fn attenuation_factor(&self) -> f64 {
-        f64::from_bits(self.0.load(Ordering::Relaxed))
+        1.0
     }
 }
